# Build, install and gate residue. Nothing else belongs here: every other file in
# this repository is written by the release mirror, so a hand-kept file is either
# deleted on the next release or needs an exception that puts it outside the
# release guard's scan.
#
# `evals/logs/` is that one exception, and it is deliberately absent from the
# list below. Logs live there, one directory per rollout, and they are committed
# by hand — put there on purpose, as a demonstration or with official results.
# The release step excludes the directory at the root, so the mirror neither
# writes nor deletes inside it and nothing there is scanned. An ignore rule here
# would refuse the release instead: the destination must be wholly clean with
# ignored files counted.
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
